# Build context for evals/Dockerfile (repo root). Keep the image to what
# `pnpm install` + `pnpm build` + the eval harness need; never ship results,
# secrets, git history, or host-built node_modules (macOS binaries).
.git
**/node_modules
.env
.env.*
**/.env
**/.env.*
.vercel
.claude
website
dist
dist-coverage
coverage
build-out
temp_tarball
tmp
generated
bench
daloyjs_podcasts
evals/results
red-team-live/results
*.log
